bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"DFF Start\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Start.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Start.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/DFF_Start.png/revision/latest?cb=20201209045748\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest?cb=20141117182922\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Stigma of Chaos\"><img alt=\"Stigma of Chaos\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Stigma Of Chaos.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/73/DFF_Stigma_Of_Chaos.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/39?cb=20141117182922\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">5\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Fleeting Flash\"><img alt=\"Fleeting Flash\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\">&#160;\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">6\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/Dissicon_ff8_Squ1.png/revision/latest?cb=20101120015408\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Squall - Assist\"><img alt=\"Squall - Assist\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"34\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Dissicon ff8 Squ1.png\" data-image-key=\"Dissicon_ff8_Squ1.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/7/7a/Dissicon_ff8_Squ1.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/34?cb=20101120015408\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203235357\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Ephemeral Vision\"><img alt=\"Ephemeral Vision\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"33\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Hard Battle Piece.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/5/58/DFF_Hard_Battle_Piece.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/33?cb=20110203235357\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">7\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest?cb=20110203234631\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Soul of Valor\"><img alt=\"Soul of Valor\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DFF Chest.png\" data-image-key=\"DFF_Chest.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/3/38/DFF_Chest.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/40?cb=20110203234631\" /></a></span>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Squall is here and he'll be our Assist. He is an <i>excellent</i> combo to call after landing a Satellite Beam or when the opponent is tumbling down from Machine Gun, he'll use Solid Barrel which hurts <i>a lot</i> - for direct comparison, a full-blast from Machine Gun has 32 power, while Solid Barrel has 55. And for more fun it begins a Chase teleport so we can follow up with a Shotgun blast or Ragnarok Blade. His aerial Assist...well Squall used so much awesome for his ground version he has little left for the aerial one, he uses Heel Crush, which is slow to execute and does about a third the damage Solid Barrel will do. So yeah, stick to the ground Assist, doesn't much matter through since he's only in one gateway.\n</p><p>Enemies are another Gunner and Vision with a Fleeting Flash and a Delusory Dragoon, no new tricks here except for the Dragoon, being a Strange Battle Piece and all. He begins the fight with a big Bravery boost and uses Bahamut to get more, then spams Jump the whole fight. Jump ironically leaves him wide open for Squall's assist, just be sure to call Squall <i>after</i> the landing so you don't get Assist Locked - that is, if you're unsure, when your Assist gets hit or blocked, and your gauge is locked and can't be used or charged for a period of time. The treasures here are a Fish Scale and a Soul of Valor, hey, I spoke too soon! Go pick up a new Valiant, if you're lacking in gil for it sell off those \"Soul\" accessories, or some of the Chocobo stuff your play plan might have given you. If you really need a lot, go ahead and sell the Pink Tails.\n</p><p>Outside again, go back to where we began and follow the path onward to find Vaan, who will be our Assist for the rest of the storyline. On the island beyond the breakable stone is an Assist Charge, it'll fill our Assist Gauge in a chain. There's a Capricious Reaper around here, as you may have noticed earlier Laguna's Machine Gun is a great attack to use to get the drop on enemies in the field, long range and duration for the win. Continue on to a mountain area with a Moogle, if you don't have one buy a Cross Chain, and a few Rosetta Stones if you like, there's another one in the chest nearby. For fun here, corner Vaan in a mountain and bombard him with Machine Gun. So much fun, I wish there was a gif of this. Head into the gateway now.\n</p>\n<table class=\"D012 board\" style=\"float:right\">\n\n<tbody><tr bgcolor=\"068FB0\">\n<td width=\"19px;background:white\">&#160;\n</td>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">A\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">B\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">C\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">D\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">E\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">F\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">G\n</th>\n<th style=\"width:40px\">H\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th>\n<th style=\"display:none\">\n</th></tr>\n<tr style=\"height:40px; text-align:center\">\n<th bgcolor=\"068FB0\">1\n</th>\n<th>\n</th>\n<th bgcolor=\"cabd62\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/finalfantasy/images/b/be/Dissicon_ff12_Vaan1.png/revision/latest?cb=20110126022706\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Assist - Vaan\"><img alt=\"Assist - Vaan\"  decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"31\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image